Automation should gradually become part of every Azure operational process. Organizations typically automate simple repetitive tasks first before expanding into advanced orchestration.

A roadmap may include:

* Resource deployment automation
* Monitoring automation
* Backup automation
* Patch management
* Cost optimization
* Security compliance
* Incident response
* Self-healing infrastructure

For example, administrators first automate virtual machine deployment before later implementing automated remediation for monitoring alerts.

A real-life use case is reducing manual operational effort while improving consistency across large Azure environments.

Automation enables scalable cloud operations.
